set {flags.event_find_coin_seen} = true
Just before finishing your run, a glint of metal on the sidewalk catches your eye. A coin. You have a second before your momentum carries you past.
- Dive for it! |
	Your hand closes around it. Lucky find.
	do GameState.add_stat_xp("perception", 2)
	jump morning_menu/activity_choice
- Keep the pace. |
	You stride past. Someone else's lucky day.
	jump morning_menu/activity_choice
